6502DOS V0.1.0
For the Commander X16
C>PATH$ = "C:\DOS"
C>HELPBAS
ABS AND ASC ATN BIN$ CHR$ CLEAR CLOSE CLS CMD COLOR CONT CONTINUE COS DATA 
DEEK DEF DIM DO DOKE ELSE END EXIT EXP FN FOR FRE GET GO GOSUB GOTO HELP HEX$ 
IF INPUT INPUT# INSTR INT LABELS LCASE$ LEFT$ LEN LIST LOCATE LOG LOOP MID$ 
MOD NEW NEXT NOT ON OPEN OR PAUSE PEEK PI POKE POS PRINT PRINT# QUIT READ REM 
RESTORE RETURN RIGHT$ RND RPT$ RUN SCREEN SGN SHL SHR SIN SQR ST STEP STOP 
STR$ SYS TAB TAN TEXTAT THEN TO UCASE$ VAL VPEEK VPOKE WAIT XOR 
C>HELPBAS print
PRINT [items]
  Prints numbers and strings. A ; joins items, a , moves to the next zone
  of 14 columns. A ; or , at the end keeps the cursor on the line.
  PRINT "A=";A
C>HELPBAS str$
STR$(n)
  Returns n as a string.
C>HELPBAS NOSUCH
No help for NOSUCH
C>VER
6502DOS V0.1.0
C>